## Problem Statement
Helps in improving road safety and emergency response planning.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas, NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Power BI

## Workflow
- Data cleaning
- Feature engineering
- Model building
- Evaluation

## Output
- Predicted accident severity levels
- Risk factor analysis

